# Virtual development team (shared)

Entry: [`.agents/skills/abracadabra/`](../../.agents/skills/abracadabra/SKILL.md). Session: [`vdt-session.mdc`](vdt-session.mdc). Roles: [`vdt-roles.mdc`](vdt-roles.mdc).

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  ScanEnv[list-vdt-products] --> Ask[AskQuestion env projects]
  Ask --> Disk[S0 disk]
  Disk --> Scan[Warnings-first scan]
  Scan --> Drain[Drain band]
  Drain --> Test[Product tests]
  Test --> Push[One commit + push + summary]
```

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 0 | Scan env (`list-vdt-products.sh`) → Ask **which of those** (window ≠ product) |
| 1 | Disk + clean if needed, then git + that product’s HANDOFF |
| 2 | Scan; fixable warnings → top of band |
| 3 | Drain ≤10 PH-S*; **no** mid-push |
| 4 | Product test command from [`docs/gsv/PRODUCTS.md`](../../docs/gsv/PRODUCTS.md) |
| 5 | One commit in the **product** repo; push if remote exists; summary always last |

GSV product tests: `cargo fmt -- --check` → `cargo clippy --all-targets` → `cargo test` → `gsv-loc-audit --stretch-96`. PoolAI: `cargo test-ci` in `S:/rust/poolAI`.
